  "description": "Jijon City Jijon High School. Yeo Chan-Wook, the school's most tyrannical and unstoppable child, falls in love with his ideal type at first sight. But his ideal type is... Jijon High School's top otaku, Han Yu-Ri?! Because of his heavy-duty glasses, Chan-Wook can't recognize Yu-Ri. To make matters worse, the two become mentors and mentees as part of a school-based learning program. With detection a sure death, Yu-Ri's dangerous double life begins!\n\nWill Yu-Ri be able to graduate safely without Chan-Wook discovering his identity?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
